# s_elect takes 1-origin indices on the left; f_irst is the first
# major cell; c_at joins along the leading axis (B4, B10).
== SOURCE
2 3 s_elect 10 20 30
2 s_elect 10 20 30
2 s_elect 2 3 r_eshape r_ange 6
f_irst 10 20 30
f_irst 2 3 r_eshape r_ange 6
1 2 c_at 3 4 5
0 c_at 1 2
(2 2 r_eshape 1 2 3 4) c_at 5 6
"ab" c_at "cd"
== RESULT
20 30
20
4 5 6
10
1 2 3
1 2 3 4 5
0 1 2
1 2
3 4
5 6
abcd
